  "description": "Bringing LEADER's Worldview to People WorldwideThe 721 model was created to introduce fixed gear culture to as many riders as possible while maintaining LEADER's identity. By carefully selecting components and pipes, costs were reduced without compromising quality. The 721TR, with its pure and clean form combined with dynamic handling, is the perfect companion for energetic young riders.\n\nUnique Colors and Customization\n\nThe frame and parts use standard mainstream specifications, offering a wide range of parts for customization. Available in three colors—matte black, gloss white, and matte orange—this bike can reflect the rider's individuality. It can be customized to fit various lifestyles, maximizing the enjoyment of part customization, which is a key attraction of fixed gear bikes.\n\nLightweight Aluminum Frame + Internal Brake Routing\n\nThe frame uses the same aluminum as higher models and comes standard with a full carbon fork, resulting in a lightweight build. Additionally, it features internal brake cable routing, allowing for brake installation without compromising the beautiful LEADER design.\n\nWide Range of Sizes\n\nAvailable in sizes from XS to XL, fitting a wide range of riders from women to larger men. If you're unsure about your size, feel free to contact us.\n\nNote: Front and rear brakes and pedals are included.",
